{"type":"message","id":"c9de375a","parentId":"d9796e25","timestamp":"2026-03-04T10:37:14.040Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Wed 2026-03-04 18:37 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 2/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: ## Task: 验证二进制序列化优化\n\n## Workspace: /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter\n\n## Context\ncode-agent 已完成二进制序列化优化 `collect_interface()`，现需验证：\n1. 代码编译成功\n2. 网格剖分正确\n3. CFD 模拟收敛\n\n## 环境设置\n\n```bash\nexport CGNS_ROOT=/home/one/app/cgns-4.3.0-int32\nexport METIS_ROOT=/home/one/app/metis-5.1.0-Int32Double\nexport PARMETIS_ROOT=/home/one/app/parmetis-4.0.3-Int32Double\nexport PATH=\"/home/one/app/petsc-3.14.0/bin:$PATH\"\n```\n\n## 测试步骤\n\n### 1. 编译\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\ncmake .. && make -j4\n```\n\n### 2. 网格剖分测试\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\nmpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -m pipe.cgns -np 2\n```\n\n验证输出文件生成：\n- `decomposed_mesh_0.cgns`\n- `decomposed_mesh_1.cgns`\n\n### 3. CFD 模拟验证\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\n\n# 单进程测试\n/home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# 并行测试\nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n验证收敛：\n- 残差下降趋势\n- 无崩溃/错误\n\n## 测试报告格式\n\n```markdown\n# 测试报告\n\n## 编译测试\n- 状态: ✅/❌\n- 错误信息: (如有)\n\n## 剖分测试\n- 状态: ✅/❌\n- 输出文件: decomposed_mesh_*.cgns\n- 错误信息: (如有)\n\n## CFD 验证\n- 单进程状态: ✅/❌\n- 并行状态: ✅/❌\n- 收敛情况: (描述)\n- 错误信息: (如有)\n\n## 结论\n- 总体状态: ✅ 通过 / ❌ 失败\n- 问题列表: (如有)\n```\n\n## Report To: $HOME/.openclaw-reports/test-agent/"}],"timestamp":1772620634038}}
